<figure class="fig fig-flow">
<figcaption>The winning prompt restructures <em>how</em> the model reasons, with an anti-looping constraint to stop it second-guessing itself.</figcaption>
<div class="flow">
<div class="flow-step" style="--i:0"><span class="flow-kicker">1 · Heard</span><p>Transcribe what is actually in the audio — sounds, speech, music, events — before interpreting anything.</p></div>
<div class="flow-arrow" style="--i:1">→</div>
<div class="flow-step" style="--i:2"><span class="flow-kicker">2 · Analysis</span><p>Reason over the enumerated evidence against each answer option.</p></div>
<div class="flow-arrow" style="--i:3">→</div>
<div class="flow-step" style="--i:4"><span class="flow-kicker">3 · Answer</span><p>Commit once. The anti-looping constraint forbids revisiting a settled conclusion.</p></div>
</div>
</figure>
